      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The as-cast alloy has limitations in corrosion behavior under extreme environments.",
      "field": "baseline",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "An intermediate-temperature heat treatment can induce short-range ordering at the fcc/B2 interfaces of AlCoCrFeNi2.1.",
